      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهِيدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A kind of food of the Arabs;</i> (L;) <i>thin</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصِيدَة</span>; (S, L, K;) <i>not thin so as to be supped,
